  VibeGrounds sitemap.

  Fixed pages only. Individual creations, profiles and forum threads are
  not listed here, because this is a static file and it cannot know what
  was posted this morning. Search engines still reach them by following
  links from the Portal and the charts — a sitemap speeds discovery up,
  it is not the only way in.

  Listing every creation would mean generating this file from the
  database on each deploy, or serving it from an edge function. Worth
  doing once there is enough posted to justify it.
-->
